# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Example environment configuration for the react-assignment-ui project.
#
# This project does not require any environment variables to run the library,
# Storybook, or the sample application. This file exists as a template for
# consumers who need to add their own configuration (for example, if the sample
# app were wired to a real backend or analytics service).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in the values as needed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

